<title>JAPAN: NEC shares rise on robust interim earnings results.</title>
<headline>NEC shares rise on robust interim earnings results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in NEC Corp gained ground in Monday morning trade, supported by strong earnings results for the half-year which ended on September 30, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0157 GMT, the shares were up 10 yen at 1,230 yen, with 1.595 million shares traded, making it the most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
